      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start and the tone is definitely professional. I ran it through the sentiment tool and it got a decent score, but it wasn't quite as high as we need it to be to ensure we pass the first round of the filter. \n\nCould you expand on this? I need about two more paragraphs specifically focusing on the economic benefits and the long-term sustainability of the park. Try to make it even more impactful. Again, please keep it sounding like a real planner wrote it—I don't want the council to think we're just trying to trick the system by repeating the same word over and over—but we do need that score to be higher if we're going to get through.",
